<section>
  <h2>Real-World Evaluation</h2>
  <p>
    A model trained in simulation was transferred directly to a Franka Emika Panda. The evaluation covered 200 trials across 20 robot configurations,
    with a force/torque sensor and OptiTrack markers providing ground truth. The table reports mean localization M-RMSE from Experiment D; smaller
    values are better.
  </p>
  <div class="research-content__table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="ContactFlowFilter real-world localization results">
